			-----------------------------"
		::= { ommp101AlarmQueryEntry 75 }

	ommp101SdhOutOfFrameAlarm OBJECT-TYPE
              SYNTAX  DisplayString
              MAX-ACCESS  read-only
              STATUS  current
              DESCRIPTION
			"For port configured with STM-16 traffic, when
			several consecutive SDH frames have A1, A2 bytes errored
			for a period more than 625us, this alarm will be
			generated.
